  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 09d9dd0205bab0640872e2256248d999, type: 3}
  m_Name: M1 Battle Tutorial 5 - Melee, Flanking and Surrounded
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _source: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 3584cb9e2b438094d8b7d4c8e4dd7e5a, type: 3}
  _sourcePath: Assets/Leveraged Wars Story/2. Missions/M1-Tutorial/M1 Battle Tutorial
    5 - Melee, Flanking and Surrounded.md
  _warnings: []
  _lines:
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Here it comes, my prince. Watch our front rank.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Once we touch, the first soldiers go in all together. That is the Assault.
      It hits hardest at the start. After that it is one man against another, duel
      by duel.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: 
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Why do they turn along the line of the enemy?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: To get the whole front onto them. The more of us touching, the more of
      us fighting.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: The troop that attacks turns to meet the other along its length. The troop
      being attacked stays as it is. Mind that.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Why does that matter?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Because a troop has four faces. Front, two sides and back.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Hit our front and we fight as usual. Hit our side or our back and the Shock
      triples. That is how a few good blows break a large troop.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: So my riders should go round behind them.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: That is the prince's trick, and a good one. We hold them in front, you
      ride round behind, and a whole line folds. We call it hammer and anvil.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: The enemy knows it as well as we do. See that call-out? One of ours has
      been hit from the side.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: How do I answer a flank?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Turn the troop on whoever is hitting it. Right-click the attacker and we
      shall swing to face him.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: It will not undo the first blow, but it stops the rest landing on our back.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: And what is Surrounded?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Look behind us. If an enemy stands where we would fall back to, and another
      is in front, we cannot give ground. Every break then costs us more.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Never fight with your back to the enemy and nowhere to go.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: How do I avoid it?
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Jagen
    Text: Keep a reserve behind the line. Keep your chain tight so there are no open
      sides in the middle. The ends are the weak points, so cover them or have a
      troop ready to answer.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 1
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
  - Speaker: Prince Julian
    Text: Hold them, old friend. I shall take the back.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: Jagen
    RightName: Prince Julian
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 4202274659027958708, guid: 15508f085842ca0428c16482db0b7e16,
      type: 3}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: -2861679652154964632, guid: 0747003b8d5cd804da0e2241c6efb15e,
      type: 3}
